infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Subdomain vs bounded context
  desc Problem space the business has vs solution space your team designs
  compares
    - label Subdomain: problem space
      children
        - label What the business does
          desc A part of the business problem space
        - label Discovered, not designed
          desc Found by talking to domain experts; exists without software
        - label Core / supporting / generic
          desc Differentiating, necessary, or a solved off-the-shelf problem
        - label Tells you WHAT is needed
          desc One subdomain may map to one or several contexts
    - label Bounded context: solution space
      children
        - label How the code organizes it
          desc A decision in the solution space, designed by your team
        - label A boundary in code
          desc Enforced by package or service boundaries
        - label One model, one language
          desc One team, one ubiquitous language, one deployment unit
        - label Tells you HOW it is built
          desc The primary unit of decomposition in DDD
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6
